scenario t_level is:
    the provider's retention factor is 0.92.
    the provider's programme weighting is 1.05.
    the provider's 16 to 18 area cost factor is 1.04.
    the provider's historic large programme proportion is 0.01.
    the provider's disadvantage proportion is 0.12.
    the provider's English and maths proportion is 0.03.
    learner_tl01 is a learner.
    the date of birth of learner_tl01 is 2010-01-10.
    the GCSE English grade of learner_tl01 is "4".
    the GCSE maths grade of learner_tl01 is "4".
    the postcode disadvantage uplift of learner_tl01 is 1.1.
    learner_tl01 has learner_tl01_aim_1.
    the learning aim reference of learner_tl01_aim_1 is "ZPROG001".
    the aim type of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 1.
    the aim sequence number of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 1.
    the funding model of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 25.
    the programme type of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 31.
    the learning start date of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 2026-09-07.
    the learning planned end date of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 2028-06-30.
    the completion status of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 1.
    the learning aim reference title of learner_tl01_aim_1 is "Programme aim".
    the learning aim reference type of learner_tl01_aim_1 is "ZZZZ".
    the awarding organisation code of learner_tl01_aim_1 is "PEARSON".
    the ESFA condition of funding type of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 2.
    the sector subject area tier 2 of learner_tl01_aim_1 is 4.1.
